        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Mordekaiser stores damage he deals and takes to create a shield. He may consume the shield to heal.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Passive:</span> Mordekaiser stores 45% of the damage he deals and 7.5% of the damage he takes.<br /><br /><span>Active:</span> Mordekaiser gains the stored damage as <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">Shield</span>. He may <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this Ability to restore <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">35/37.5/40/42.5/45% of the remaining Shield as Health</span>.<br /><br />Minimum Shield: <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(5% Health)</span><br />Maximum Shield: <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(30% Health)</span><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Shield decays over time.<br />Damage stored from non-champion sources reduced by 75%.</span>",
